<view class="screen"><brand-header/><view class="page-heading"><view class="kicker">STAFF ONLY</view><view class="page-title">奖品核销</view><view class="page-subtitle">核对奖品，再确认发放。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在验证工作人员身份…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="authorize">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!allowed}}" class="empty"><view class="symbol">⌑</view><view class="title">此入口仅向工作人员开放</view><view class="copy">当前微信账号没有核销权限。<view>请联系活动管理员添加账号。</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyIdentity">复制本人账号标识</button></view><block wx:else><view class="staff-form"><view wx:if="{{isDemo}}" class="tip">当前为核销演示，不产生真实发放记录。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="scan" disabled="{{busy}}">⌗ 扫描核销条形码</button><view class="label">或输入完整奖品码／购物券码</view><input class="input" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 A1B2 C3D4 E5F6 7890" placeholder-class="placeholder" maxlength="64" disabled="{{busy}}" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="lookup"/><button class="primary" bindtap="lookup" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查询奖品 →</button></view><view wx:if="{{entry}}" class="staff-result"><view class="kicker">{{entry.statusLabel}}</view><view class="large-art"><prize-art prize="{{entry.prize}}"/></view><view class="name">{{entry.prize.name}}</view><view class="code">{{entry.formattedCode}}</view><view wx:if="{{entry.checkoutCoupon}}" class="tip">此券用于购物抵扣，请在收银系统使用。付款成功后自动核销，工作人员不能在此直接发放。</view><button wx:if="{{entry.status==='pending' && !entry.checkoutCoupon}}" class="primary" bindtap="redeem" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认核销并发放</button><view wx:elif="{{!entry.checkoutCoupon}}" class="tip">此凭证不可再次领取，请勿重复发放。<view wx:if="{{entry.redeemedAt}}">核销时间：{{entry.redeemedLabel}}</view></view></view><view class="detail-box">请先核对奖品并准备好礼品。完成核销后再发放，避免重复领取。<view class="detail-title">固定扫码参与入口</view><view>获取直达抽奖页面的正式活动码，可用于海报、展台长期印刷。生成后长按图片保存。</view><button class="secondary activity-code" bindtap="activityCode" disabled="{{busy}}">获取固定活动码 ↗</button></view></block><bottom-nav active="staff" locked="{{busy}}"/></view>
